olved"}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2423718887","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98324#issuecomment-2423718887","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98324","id":2423718887,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6QdwPn","user":{"login":"alliephante","id":112137107,"node_id":"U_kgDOBq8Tkw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/112137107?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alliephante","html_url":"https://github.com/alliephante","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alliephante/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alliephante/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alliephante/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alliephante/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alliephante/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alliephante/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alliephante/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alliephante/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alliephante/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-10-19T09:29:23Z","updated_at":"2024-10-20T20:16:02Z","body":"> Thanks for opening a pull request!\r\n> \r\n> Feature pull requests should be associated to a feature proposal to justify the need for implementing the feature in Godot core. Please open a proposal on the [Godot proposals](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals) repository (and link to this pull request in the proposal's body).\r\n\r\nI believe the closest one would be https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/5188\r\n\r\nSpecifically: https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/5188#issuecomment-1219349720\r\n\r\nI couldn't find precisely one \"feature proposal\" that was purely for navigation layers in AStar, but it's scattered around in a few. (according to the comment, I had a hard time finding them, but going off that it's been apparently discussed a few times at least). In the one I linked though it sorta morphed into adding bitmask navigation layers by the end, but was never renamed or clarified in the body of it.\r\n\r\nThere was an initial tackle of this issue with PR https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/64641 however it did not target master and also had additional changes involved so was not accepted. \r\n\r\nThis PR also has another mention to a \"navigation layers\" proposal, but I couldn't find a source for it.\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/64641#issuecomment-1221359903\r\n\r\n\r\nWould you like me to open a feature that is specific to navigation layers for AStar?\r\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2423718887/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":{"reason":"resolved"}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2423723126","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98324#issuecomment-2423723126","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98324","id":2423723126,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6QdxR2","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.gith